        <p><b>Island:</b> Ambae (Penama Province)</p>
        <p><a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/?mlat=-15.38&mlon=167.83#map=12/-15.38/167.83">View on OpenStreetMap</a></p>
      ]]></description>
      <Point>
        <coordinates>167.83,-15.38,1496</coordinates>
      </Point>
    </Placemark>
